<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan to auction 500 mln tenge bills April 1.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan to auction 500 mln tenge bills April 1.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 500 million tenge of three-month GKO discount Treasury bills on April 1, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K0307977</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   500 million tenge</p>
<p>    Issue date		     April 1</p>
<p>    Term			     91 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  July 3, 1997</p>
<p>The three-month paper yielded an average of 22.56 percent at the last auction on March 25.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
